1
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:15,720
Turn on the lights, Li.

2
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:01,420
(Zhuang Haitao)

3
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:03,700
(Longfan City First Hospital.
Oral Medication)

4
00:01:17,510 --> 00:01:18,310
Captain Qin.

5
00:01:27,140 --> 00:01:31,140
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 22=

6
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,350
Captain Qin.

7
00:01:37,790 --> 00:01:39,950
Where could Zhuang Haitao be hiding?

8
00:01:39,950 --> 00:01:41,870
We've searched everywhere we could.

9
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,430
No leads.

10
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:52,590
Hello? Did you catch him?

11
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,150
Wang Li, we've got a lead.

12
00:01:57,230 --> 00:01:59,000
Captain Qin, it's me.

13
00:02:01,310 --> 00:02:02,200
Zhuang Haitao.

14
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:04,790
You've been looking for me, haven't you?

15
00:02:06,230 --> 00:02:07,870
I'll tell you where I am.

16
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,400
What do you want?

17
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:18,840
Dad...

18
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,560
Hear that?

19
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:24,710
Head north along the Longfan River.

20
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:26,470
There's a cave there.

21
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:28,630
Come alone.

22
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:31,120
If anyone else comes,

23
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,430
you'll never see this boy again.

24
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:11,560
Captain Qin.

25
00:03:12,630 --> 00:03:13,430
Captain Qin.

26
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:14,520
Captain Qin!

27
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,030
What's wrong?

28
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,080
Nothing.

29
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:26,120
Section Chief Qin.

30
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:27,960
The lab results are back

31
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,960
on the sample from the nail gun.

32
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,560
They've been sent to your printer.

33
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:31,800
Okay, I'll check them now.

34
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:40,910
Ma.

35
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,310
Ma!

36
00:03:42,310 --> 00:03:42,870
Get the others.

37
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:43,710
What's up, Li?

38
00:03:43,710 --> 00:03:44,470
Come with me.

39
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:46,190
The captain said before he left,

40
00:03:46,190 --> 00:03:48,000
if he's not back in an hour,
we should go find him.

41
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:59,820
(Police)

42
00:04:08,670 --> 00:04:09,520
Dad!

43
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,240
Ming!

44
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,120
Dad's here.

45
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:13,080
Dad's here.

46
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:14,000
Stop right there!

47
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,920
Dad!

48
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:18,120
- Zhuang Haitao.
- Dad!

49
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:19,720
- Didn't you want to make a deal?
- Dad!

50
00:04:19,870 --> 00:04:20,950
Dad!

51
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:21,800
Name your terms.

52
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,950
You're in no position
to negotiate with me.

53
00:04:24,630 --> 00:04:25,430
Dad!

54
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,360
All you can do now is follow my orders.

55
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,560
What do you want?

56
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,510
A way out.

57
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,750
Tell them you got it wrong.

58
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,000
It wasn't me.

59
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:35,600
Lift all the roadblocks.

60
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,950
Get me a car and money.

61
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,430
I'm leaving this place.

62
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,950
And I'll never come back.

63
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:43,830
Impossible.

64
00:04:43,830 --> 00:04:44,800
You won't agree?

65
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,160
Fine.

66
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:50,120
Then you and your son

67
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,870
can die here with me today.

68
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,810
Dad!

69
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,800
Ming!

70
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,870
Make your choice.

71
00:05:27,950 --> 00:05:30,070
Let me go, or we all die together.

72
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:31,000
Zhuang Haitao!

73
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,630
You're a murderer.

74
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:34,070
How could I possibly let you go?

75
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:36,120
You're responsible for so many deaths.

76
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,800
We have solid evidence for all of them!

77
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,190
To hell with your evidence!

78
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,190
Huo Qicheng got what he deserved.

79
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,160
His death was divine punishment.

80
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,830
It had nothing to do with me!

81
00:05:45,870 --> 00:05:47,870
I was supposed to die
in that explosion that day.

82
00:05:47,870 --> 00:05:49,800
But you had to go and save me!

83
00:05:55,310 --> 00:05:56,480
I lost my daughter.

84
00:05:57,630 --> 00:05:58,720
I lost my wife.

85
00:05:59,390 --> 00:06:00,560
I lost my family.

86
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,360
You wanted me to live.

87
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,040
Fine.

88
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:07,360
So I lived.

89
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,390
And now you're framing me.

90
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,270
Huo Qicheng was the one who was guilty!

91
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,070
Go arrest them!

92
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:16,040
Don't think I don't know anything!

93
00:06:17,310 --> 00:06:18,720
Your son is only five.

94
00:06:18,830 --> 00:06:20,950
How could he know
there was a gun in that box?

95
00:06:21,270 --> 00:06:22,630
Or that Zhao Qian was sick?

96
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,360
Dad!

97
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,430
What secret are you and your son hiding?

98
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,630
Tell me!

99
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,560
You want to know?

100
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,600
I can tell you.

101
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,720
If he dies,
there won't be any secret left.

102
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:46,920
Zhuang Haitao!

103
00:06:46,950 --> 00:06:48,040
Dad!

104
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:50,560
Dad!

105
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,750
- Let my son go.
- Dad!

106
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,150
Dad!

107
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:55,000
- Once he's dead,
- Dad!

108
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:58,160
- whether it's now or in the future,
- Dad!

109
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,070
you'll never catch me.

110
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:03,190
Dad!

111
00:07:03,390 --> 00:07:05,020
- You, come here.
- Dad!

112
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,360
Son.

113
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,510
Dad's here.

114
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,270
Dad!

115
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,680
Dad!

116
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:17,310
Don't be afraid, son.

117
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,150
Dad!

118
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,800
Say you were wrong.

119
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,920
I wasn't wrong.

120
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,390
Say it!

121
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:28,310
No!

122
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:46,160
Ming, don't be afraid.

123
00:07:46,630 --> 00:07:47,310
Dad's here.

124
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:48,560
This is all because of you.

125
00:07:48,870 --> 00:07:49,680
Get up.

126
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,720
I'm giving you one last chance.

127
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,510
Say you were wrong.

128
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:00,390
Zhuang Haitao.

129
00:08:01,950 --> 00:08:03,040
I have never wronged you.

130
00:08:03,190 --> 00:08:04,680
Neither has anyone

131
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,120
at the Longfan City

132
00:08:06,390 --> 00:08:07,800
Public Security Bureau!

133
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:22,560
Son!

134
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,920
Son!

135
00:08:26,190 --> 00:08:27,120
Dad's here.

136
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:28,120
Dad's here.

137
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,000
Dad's here.

138
00:08:34,790 --> 00:08:35,600
Don't cry.

139
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,870
- Dad's here.
- Dad!

140
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:39,280
Dad's here.

141
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:41,870
Dad!

142
00:08:44,270 --> 00:08:45,870
Dad!

143
00:08:47,390 --> 00:08:49,000
Dad!

144
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:53,960
Dad's right here.

145
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,790
Don't be afraid.

146
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:56,790
Be good. Don't cry!

147
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:02,910
Son.

148
00:09:02,910 --> 00:09:04,390
Stay right here and don't move.

149
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:06,080
Li will be here to get you soon.

150
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,120
Dad will be back in a little while.

151
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:07,550
Be good.

152
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,480
No!

153
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,960
Dad!

154
00:09:15,030 --> 00:09:16,320
When I grow up,

155
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:19,670
I'll catch you with Dad!

156
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:26,870
Qin.

157
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,720
Looks like you saved me once too.

158
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,270
Son, come back!

159
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,270
Mom.

160
00:09:49,790 --> 00:09:50,360
Ming.

161
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,510
Mom, are you okay?

162
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,240
You still can't tell me

163
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,960
what exactly is going on?

164
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,600
Mom.

165
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:06,240
It's a little hard to explain.

166
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:06,960
But I know

167
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,600
your memories have changed again.

168
00:10:08,790 --> 00:10:09,840
But trust me.

169
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,080
I'll protect myself,

170
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,480
and I'll protect Dad too.

171
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:13,480
Son.

172
00:10:13,870 --> 00:10:15,870
Zhuang Haitao is too dangerous.

173
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:17,440
He won't leave us alone.

174
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,840
Can you please stop getting involved

175
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,270
in those things from the past?

176
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:21,200
Zhuang Haitao?

177
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,320
You remember Zhuang Haitao now?

178
00:10:24,270 --> 00:10:25,750
That man is terrifying.

179
00:10:26,270 --> 00:10:27,670
He's truly terrifying.

180
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,840
Mom, it doesn't hurt.

181
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:36,080
It may not hurt you,
but it hurts me to see you like this.

182
00:10:42,510 --> 00:10:43,320
Qin Tian.

183
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,960
What exactly happened?

184
00:10:45,550 --> 00:10:46,750
Who did this?

185
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:51,200
Our son's safety is at risk now.

186
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,720
I need to know.

187
00:10:54,390 --> 00:10:55,200
Zhuang.

188
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,030
Zhuang Haitao.

189
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:03,030
I'll tell you the truth.

190
00:11:03,390 --> 00:11:04,510
Zhuang Haitao escaped.

191
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,910
You don't know him.

192
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,000
He's extremely dangerous.

193
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,630
And most importantly,

194
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:12,870
he knows where we live.

195
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,750
So I have to get back to the bureau

196
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:19,960
and organize the search for him.

197
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:21,240
As long as he's still out there,

198
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,720
I won't have a moment's peace.

199
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,600
All right, don't worry too much.

200
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,000
Listen.

201
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,910
After I leave,

202
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:37,480
lock all the doors and windows.

203
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:40,240
I've written down the number

204
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:41,480
for the duty office at the bureau.

205
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,670
I left it by the phone

206
00:11:42,670 --> 00:11:43,600
in case you forget.

207
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,360
If anything happens,

208
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,630
call this number immediately.

209
00:11:45,630 --> 00:11:46,440
Okay?

210
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:48,750
I'm leaving now.

211
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,270
I'll take care of things here.

212
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,360
Don't worry.

213
00:11:54,870 --> 00:11:56,550
You have to catch him.

214
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:58,750
I know.

215
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:03,750
Give me some encouragement.

216
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:06,870
Mom.

217
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,600
It really doesn't hurt.

218
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:19,750
All passenger
and cargo ferries at the port

219
00:12:19,750 --> 00:12:21,080
are to remain docked for now.

220
00:12:21,150 --> 00:12:22,840
(Criminal Investigation Case File)
Check the identity of every ticket holder.

221
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,960
At the train station
and long-distance bus station,

222
00:12:25,030 --> 00:12:26,270
conduct thorough checks.

223
00:12:29,030 --> 00:12:29,840
Also,

224
00:12:30,150 --> 00:12:32,080
these farm roads
leading to neighboring counties,

225
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:32,960
along with the smaller roads,

226
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,670
must all have checkpoints.

227
00:12:34,790 --> 00:12:35,600
Li.

228
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:38,360
(Longfan City Map)
A few new roads have been added in this area.

229
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,390
Make sure none are overlooked.

230
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:40,200
Understood.

231
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,480
I think this plan will work.

232
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:43,480
But be careful how you carry it out.

233
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,240
Avoid causing widespread panic.

234
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,080
Each of you lead a team and split up.

235
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:47,840
- Yes!
- Yes!

236
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:24,910
Captain Qin.

237
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:26,550
Do you think we'll find anything

238
00:13:26,550 --> 00:13:27,360
at Zhuang Haitao's home this time?

239
00:15:07,150 --> 00:15:08,080
We can conclude that

240
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:09,150
the victim, Liu Yan,

241
00:15:09,670 --> 00:15:11,670
was subjected to an extremely brutal

242
00:15:11,670 --> 00:15:13,670
and sadistic killing
before her heart was removed.

243
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,510
That's sick.

244
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,480
What a monster.

245
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:19,360
Yeah, it's sick.

246
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:20,480
We need to find him fast.

247
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:21,200
Yes.

248
00:16:09,550 --> 00:16:10,120
Haitao.

249
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:13,600
Haitao, let's not get divorced.

250
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:16,630
Once everything with the Urban
Construction Group blows over,

251
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:17,670
we...

252
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,720
We can

253
00:16:18,910 --> 00:16:20,630
move somewhere else
as a family and start over.

254
00:16:20,630 --> 00:16:21,200
Haitao.

255
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:22,600
Haitao.

256
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:23,480
What do you mean?

257
00:16:23,870 --> 00:16:25,200
You're still trying to lie to me?

258
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:27,150
Believe me.

259
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:29,030
Give me a month.

260
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:30,600
No, half a month.

261
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,720
Once this blows over,

262
00:16:31,790 --> 00:16:32,790
I'll take care of everything.

263
00:16:33,150 --> 00:16:33,910
I swear.

264
00:16:33,910 --> 00:16:34,480
Haitao.

265
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,240
What about me?

266
00:16:45,630 --> 00:16:46,550
Haitao.

267
00:16:46,670 --> 00:16:49,720
They have something on me.

268
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:52,000
I can't get away.

269
00:16:52,750 --> 00:16:53,670
If someone

270
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:57,630
has to get their hands dirty,
let it be me.

271
00:16:58,270 --> 00:16:59,200
You and our daughter

272
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:03,200
can live without any
of this hanging over you, okay?

273
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:08,590
It's too late.

274
00:17:28,770 --> 00:17:33,290
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

275
00:17:36,330 --> 00:17:41,130
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

276
00:17:43,850 --> 00:17:49,210
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

277
00:17:49,730 --> 00:17:55,090
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

278
00:17:57,090 --> 00:18:05,050
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

279
00:18:05,690 --> 00:18:10,730
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

280
00:18:12,770 --> 00:18:21,090
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

281
00:18:21,090 --> 00:18:26,930
♪But that goodbye became the last♪

282
00:18:28,410 --> 00:18:36,530
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

283
00:18:37,210 --> 00:18:42,250
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

284
00:18:44,050 --> 00:18:52,090
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

285
00:18:52,370 --> 00:18:59,610
♪I suddenly long to call out to you♪

286
00:18:59,810 --> 00:19:04,250
♪Can you hear me?♪

287
00:19:04,250 --> 00:19:08,050
♪Can you hear me?♪

288
00:19:08,050 --> 00:19:15,490
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

289
00:19:15,490 --> 00:19:23,250
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

290
00:19:23,570 --> 00:19:29,170
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

291
